Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 15:28:52 +0800
Subject: [RFC PATCH 4/5] debug messenger events

Instrument messenger send and receive events to distinguish send-queue
waiting from subsequent message processing. Requires message correlation
context from patch 0003.

